WEBVTT

01:32.383 --> 01:34.511
Oh!

02:03.832 --> 02:09.337
Dongcheon! Dongcheon! Dongcheon!
Dongcheon! Dongcheon! Dongcheon!

02:09.420 --> 02:13.049
Dongcheon! Dongcheon! Dongcheon!
Dongcheon! Dongcheon!

02:15.635 --> 02:17.011
You're awake, dumbass?

02:17.095 --> 02:19.055
Hey, are you finally awake?

02:19.139 --> 02:20.932
Get out here and die.

02:24.811 --> 02:27.981
You got your ass beat by a girl
and you blacked out.

02:28.064 --> 02:29.941
I wanna kill myself out of humiliation.

03:04.225 --> 03:05.435
About earlier…

03:09.898 --> 03:11.399
I wanna apologize.

03:13.234 --> 03:15.695
Apologize for what?

03:16.863 --> 03:18.114
It's just a fight.

03:26.164 --> 03:28.291
Hey, man, you wanna hang out now?

03:29.292 --> 03:31.419
Why? So you can get drunk?

03:31.502 --> 03:32.962
Black out and die.

03:33.046 --> 03:34.130
Uh, no.

03:35.006 --> 03:36.758
I thought we could go…

03:57.028 --> 03:58.112
What?

03:59.239 --> 04:01.908
Don't be such a pussy.
You're always saying you want her.

04:02.659 --> 04:04.244
Asshole, do you lost its fucking mind?

04:06.037 --> 04:07.288
Hey.

04:07.372 --> 04:09.165
Don't do anything stupid, man.

04:09.249 --> 04:10.750
You know the boss brought her.

04:10.833 --> 04:12.919
And she won't remember anything though.

04:14.671 --> 04:16.506
You know, I roofied her water earlier.

05:06.472 --> 05:08.933
Such a stingy little shit, bro.

05:09.934 --> 05:12.895
Well, if you really wanna go that far,
I guess I can't refuse.

05:15.815 --> 05:16.649
Yo.

05:17.817 --> 05:19.902
You don't have to come
if you're so scared.

05:40.715 --> 05:42.216
I owe you, Gangjae.

05:44.427 --> 05:48.473
You know, you're the prettiest
little thing around, fucking slut.

05:48.556 --> 05:50.350
Ah, you make me so hard.

05:50.433 --> 05:51.684
I wanna taste you.

05:54.270 --> 05:55.730
Aah.

05:56.856 --> 05:58.608
Ah, promise I won't be too rough.

05:58.691 --> 05:59.942
Hold still.

06:04.280 --> 06:05.907
You need to calm down.

06:06.491 --> 06:08.326
The whole thing will be over soon.

06:10.995 --> 06:13.039
Stay.

06:13.122 --> 06:14.957
Oh! Dirty slut, I can't take it.

06:16.959 --> 06:18.127
DECEASED, YOON DONGHOON

06:18.211 --> 06:20.296
Oh, Jesus!

06:20.380 --> 06:21.506
Oh!

06:27.053 --> 06:28.679
I'm gonna kill you guys.

06:28.763 --> 06:29.639
Fuck!

06:30.431 --> 06:32.600
I swear I'm gonna kill you guys.

06:32.683 --> 06:34.769
It's the fucking bitch…

06:35.728 --> 06:37.355
Shit!

06:37.438 --> 06:38.940
You fucking psycho bitch!

06:44.195 --> 06:46.489
No!

06:50.827 --> 06:51.661
You need to die.

06:53.204 --> 06:54.205
Get over here, bitch.

06:54.288 --> 06:57.375
Gangjae! I'm all fucked up now!

06:57.458 --> 06:58.292
Yeah?

06:58.376 --> 07:00.128
That piece of shit!

07:01.796 --> 07:03.756
Come here.

07:03.840 --> 07:05.842
Where are you going, you dumb slut?

07:11.472 --> 07:13.724
- Gangjae! Stop it! Hey! Gangjae!
- Fucking bitch.

07:30.950 --> 07:33.536
Your face, arms, or legs.

07:35.163 --> 07:36.164
Which one?

07:37.582 --> 07:39.083
I'm only going to mutilate one.

07:52.847 --> 07:54.307
I'm really sorry, sir.

07:55.850 --> 07:56.851
Sir, I made a mistake.

07:57.560 --> 07:58.811
And that's why…

08:01.314 --> 08:02.732
I chose not to kill you.

08:02.815 --> 08:04.025
Which one?

08:06.819 --> 08:08.362
Are you gonna get rid of me?

08:11.532 --> 08:13.784
You said I was useful to have around.

08:13.868 --> 08:15.536
It's most unfortunate.

08:21.125 --> 08:23.669
I assumed this would eventually
happen to her.

08:23.753 --> 08:25.922
That it was something
she had to go through.

08:27.548 --> 08:28.841
Though I didn't know…

08:33.846 --> 08:35.389
it would be you who did it.

08:35.473 --> 08:37.808
Please forgive me, sir.

08:39.185 --> 08:41.479
All I did was push her around a little!

08:44.065 --> 08:46.692
I, myself, brought her here.

08:49.028 --> 08:50.780
You shouldn't have even touched her.

09:01.123 --> 09:02.250
Okay, which one?

09:05.795 --> 09:07.046
No, I'll decide.

09:08.214 --> 09:10.216
Sir, I'm sorry. No. Please. No.

09:10.299 --> 09:13.052
Please, I'm begging you.

09:49.547 --> 09:54.552
DECEASED, YOON DONGHOON

11:35.361 --> 11:37.029
If you're done crying,
please leave.

11:39.448 --> 11:40.533
Because of you,

11:41.325 --> 11:43.619
I've lost one of my best subordinates.

11:46.330 --> 11:47.665
This will be your last chance.

11:49.667 --> 11:52.002
Your very last chance to wise up.

11:54.839 --> 11:56.465
Well, I'm not going anywhere.

12:00.678 --> 12:02.054
When I served Donghoon,

12:02.638 --> 12:03.848
I got to know him very well.

12:05.433 --> 12:07.518
He didn't belong in this line of work.

12:08.686 --> 12:10.187
I can say the same about you.

12:12.398 --> 12:13.649
You should get out now.

12:18.279 --> 12:20.322
It's too late for me to get out.

12:50.060 --> 12:51.103
Sit down.

13:02.907 --> 13:05.117
I used to come here
with Donghoon all the time.

13:08.704 --> 13:10.331
Did your dad teach you to drink?

13:22.384 --> 13:23.302
Drink up.

13:38.609 --> 13:39.777
It hurts?

13:43.405 --> 13:44.448
Uh, no.

13:47.159 --> 13:49.453
You never learned how to say
that you're in pain.

13:51.205 --> 13:52.915
Or maybe no one taught you.

13:57.044 --> 13:58.587
Yeah, there was someone…

14:01.465 --> 14:02.675
but he's dead now.

14:07.221 --> 14:08.722
The whole purpose of living…

14:10.099 --> 14:12.643
could be a search
for when to find a person like that.

14:14.436 --> 14:16.689
A person who can tell that you're in pain

14:17.565 --> 14:19.024
and that life is too hard.

14:22.111 --> 14:23.654
Have you found someone like that?

14:25.656 --> 14:27.116
Yes, I did, but he died.

14:30.995 --> 14:33.247
OCTOPUS STIR-FRY
PORK STIR-FRY

14:54.059 --> 14:56.353
As of today, Yoon Jiwoo is dead.

14:59.607 --> 15:01.525
Do Gangjae has been expelled.

15:02.359 --> 15:03.402
It's punishment for

15:03.986 --> 15:05.613
having murdered that girl.

15:07.656 --> 15:09.074
Oh Hyejin.

15:11.368 --> 15:12.620
From this point on,

15:14.496 --> 15:16.123
you're going to go by this name.

15:29.136 --> 15:31.055
Here's the gun that killed your dad.

15:32.139 --> 15:34.433
The killer left it,
and we recovered it.

15:37.186 --> 15:38.687
So who was it?

15:39.480 --> 15:41.231
This gun is a police issue.

15:43.317 --> 15:45.110
Donghoon's killer is a policeman.

15:47.404 --> 15:48.906
You're gonna find him.

15:50.366 --> 15:51.533
Kill him.

16:55.431 --> 16:58.058
From now on,
your life belongs to the organization.

17:00.144 --> 17:04.023
No matter what happens,
the organization will protect you.

17:05.649 --> 17:08.027
But betray us, and we will kill you.

17:46.982 --> 17:48.400
What do we do now?

17:50.360 --> 17:51.570
We're going upstairs.

17:52.780 --> 17:53.739
What?

17:54.573 --> 17:56.116
We don't know how many are in there.

18:23.477 --> 18:25.979
Hey. Call backup and go to the front.

18:41.453 --> 18:43.163
Where are you--

19:09.273 --> 19:10.274
Who are you?

19:10.774 --> 19:11.733
What?

19:13.277 --> 19:14.403
What's going on?

19:14.486 --> 19:16.613
Which department are you with,
you dumbass?

19:46.560 --> 19:47.853
Whoo!

20:40.656 --> 20:41.657
Money first.

20:44.534 --> 20:45.535
Hey.

20:46.536 --> 20:48.455
I'm not giving you that.
You know what it's worth?

20:48.538 --> 20:49.957
Now, go and call your boss in here.

20:52.918 --> 20:55.295
I gonna see the guy's face
if we're gonna be working together.

20:55.379 --> 20:57.214
It's gonna be an equally shared risk.

20:59.091 --> 21:00.175
Now…

21:01.510 --> 21:04.680
the supply has been running a little low.

21:04.763 --> 21:06.682
Apparently, not for you guys, huh?

21:06.765 --> 21:07.975
Yeah. Forget it. Never mind.

21:08.058 --> 21:09.559
Okay. Fine.

21:10.936 --> 21:11.770
Sit down.

21:12.604 --> 21:13.647
Okay.

21:14.690 --> 21:16.525
Radio her. Tell her it's a sting.

21:18.819 --> 21:19.778
Fuckin'…

21:20.904 --> 21:21.905
right now.

21:23.073 --> 21:25.951
This jackass came here alone
and now he wants to talk in person.

21:26.034 --> 21:27.577
Hyejin.

21:27.661 --> 21:29.162
- I think I can take him down…
- I'm letting you know.

21:29.246 --> 21:32.124
This is a sting operation. Hyejin. Hyejin!

21:34.376 --> 21:37.296
- Freeze where you are, this is the police!
- Are you fucking narc?

21:37.379 --> 21:38.922
- What the hell is she saying?
- Hey, Changoo, get up.

21:39.006 --> 21:40.465
Oh, shit!

21:40.549 --> 21:43.343
- Grab the knife over there!
- Hurry, come on!

21:44.803 --> 21:46.138
Oh, shit.

21:46.221 --> 21:47.431
Stop right there!

21:47.514 --> 21:49.433
What the hell?

22:15.500 --> 22:17.252
Let's go! Don't let them…

22:17.336 --> 22:18.920
Block them right there!

22:22.090 --> 22:25.635
Park Changoo. You're under arrest
for the murder of Lee Sumin.

22:26.887 --> 22:29.014
Goddamn it!
I can walk on my own.

22:29.097 --> 22:30.599
- Hey.
- Shit.

22:30.682 --> 22:32.017
- Stop right there.
- Fuck.

22:32.100 --> 22:33.643
- Hey!
- Fuck! Argh!

22:33.727 --> 22:35.103
- Damnit. Damnit.
- I said I can walk on my own.

22:35.187 --> 22:36.188
- Hey!
- Shit!

22:40.067 --> 22:41.526
So, who the hell are you?

22:41.610 --> 22:42.944
No, who the hell are you?

22:43.028 --> 22:43.987
What?

22:47.783 --> 22:49.534
I'm Sergeant Jeon Pildo from Narcotics.

22:49.618 --> 22:52.454
Oh, shit, you really are a narc!

22:53.038 --> 22:54.998
Corporal Oh from Violent Crimes Unit Two.

22:56.166 --> 22:57.209
Hey, are you okay?

22:57.292 --> 22:58.585
Can you try and get up?

22:58.668 --> 22:59.920
My leg. Aah!

23:00.003 --> 23:01.421
- I think my leg is broken.
- Hey, try and relax.

23:03.965 --> 23:05.050
- Get an ambulance.
- Yeah.

23:05.133 --> 23:06.468
Let's clean all this up.

23:07.219 --> 23:08.553
Hey. Where's Pildo?

23:08.637 --> 23:09.888
He's upstairs.

23:12.391 --> 23:14.226
Do you have any idea what you've done?

23:14.309 --> 23:15.435
Yeah. I think I do.

23:16.395 --> 23:18.939
- I have an idea.
- Well, that's not enough.

23:19.022 --> 23:22.526
You just ruined a sting operation
we've been setting up for six months.

23:24.194 --> 23:25.445
We'll take care of this asshole.

23:25.529 --> 23:26.905
Stop!

23:26.988 --> 23:29.032
- You can't do that.
- I can't…

23:29.116 --> 23:30.700
I can't do that?

23:31.493 --> 23:33.620
You don't know how to talk
to your superiors, huh?

23:34.704 --> 23:35.914
Are you trying to fuck with me?

23:35.997 --> 23:37.916
- He's suspected of murder.
- Hyejin!

23:40.335 --> 23:41.628
It's Captain Lee for you.

23:43.255 --> 23:44.464
- Let's go.
- Aw!

23:44.548 --> 23:46.174
Hey! God!

23:48.176 --> 23:49.344
Yeah.

23:51.012 --> 23:52.264
What?

23:54.266 --> 23:55.559
Understood, sir.

23:59.563 --> 24:01.106
Send him over to us once you're through.

24:02.858 --> 24:03.900
Hey, wait, stop.

24:03.984 --> 24:05.402
- Oh, god.
- Hey!

24:06.862 --> 24:09.072
I don't wanna see you again, huh?

24:09.156 --> 24:11.324
Let's go.

24:11.408 --> 24:12.742
Damn it.

24:12.826 --> 24:15.036
I'll fuckin' walk on my own!

24:16.955 --> 24:18.623
- Argh! Ah!
- Hurry it up.

24:19.124 --> 24:20.417
Damn it.

24:38.560 --> 24:40.228
You son of a bitch!

24:55.744 --> 24:57.120
Mister… Mr. Choi.

24:57.204 --> 24:59.498
I, uh… I, I was wrong, okay?

25:00.207 --> 25:02.834
This will… This will never ever
happen again, huh?

25:03.418 --> 25:06.004
We've worked together…
together for ten years, huh?

25:06.087 --> 25:07.297
Please, sir. I beg you.

25:13.303 --> 25:14.387
Exactly.

25:17.057 --> 25:19.476
So why did you do it
if we worked together for so long?

25:21.811 --> 25:23.647
Don't you know what kind of guy I am?

25:23.730 --> 25:26.358
I, I give you the whole factory
and all the drugs I have.

25:26.441 --> 25:27.567
I…

25:27.651 --> 25:29.486
I must have… have lost…

25:29.569 --> 25:31.238
lost my mind for a minute there.

25:31.321 --> 25:33.573
I, uh…

25:33.657 --> 25:34.699
Please don't do this.

25:35.450 --> 25:36.576
My daughter…

25:36.660 --> 25:38.245
She just started school.

25:39.829 --> 25:42.207
So then I'll make sure
that the funeral runs smoothly.

25:42.958 --> 25:44.042
Mr. Choi.

25:45.585 --> 25:46.836
Mr. Choi.

25:47.462 --> 25:49.381
Mr. Choi.

25:54.010 --> 25:55.262
No. Mr. Choi!

25:55.345 --> 25:57.138
What are you… What…

25:58.431 --> 26:01.643
Mr. Choi! You fucking… Aah!

26:56.740 --> 26:59.659
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

27:07.208 --> 27:08.627
Did you get them checked?

27:16.384 --> 27:17.761
Corporal Oh Hyejin?

27:25.644 --> 27:27.187
Yes, I'm Oh Hyejin, sir.

27:32.692 --> 27:34.027
You know who I am?

27:37.864 --> 27:38.865
I do, sir.

27:40.158 --> 27:42.035
Captain Cha Giho of the Narcotics Bureau.

27:50.543 --> 27:52.962
OFFICER: OPEN RECRUIT
CORPORAL: SPECIAL PROMOTION

27:53.046 --> 27:56.549
FATHER: OH JINYEONG
MOTHER: BAE SUYEON

27:57.133 --> 27:58.426
Why did you do it?

27:59.010 --> 28:00.011
What?

28:00.887 --> 28:02.889
Your evidence was somewhat inconclusive.

28:04.599 --> 28:05.934
So the arrest was uncalled for.

28:06.017 --> 28:09.729
Well, I believe the motive was clear
and he posed a serious flight risk, sir.

28:09.813 --> 28:11.231
Yes, but that's not a valid reason.

28:11.314 --> 28:12.941
Park Changoo has three priors on record.

28:13.024 --> 28:15.485
I'm sure he would have fled
if I told him I was a cop.

28:16.277 --> 28:17.862
So I believe it was valid.

28:25.578 --> 28:27.080
You've applied to this bureau twice.

28:28.707 --> 28:30.750
- Yes.
- Why so eager?

28:30.834 --> 28:32.669
Why do you wanna join this bureau?

28:35.380 --> 28:37.006
Because there's someone I wanna find.

28:37.090 --> 28:38.091
Who's that?

28:41.970 --> 28:43.763
Is it something you can tell me about?

28:47.809 --> 28:49.269
I like punks like you.

28:49.936 --> 28:53.773
You won't survive if you're only here
for the salary or the pension.

29:40.403 --> 29:42.071
Were you waiting for a while?

29:42.655 --> 29:43.865
Hmm.

29:45.784 --> 29:46.743
Here you go.

29:51.915 --> 29:54.042
What's in here?

29:54.626 --> 29:58.129
Chamomile tea.
It's supposed to help with insomnia.

29:58.630 --> 30:00.423
I know you have trouble sleeping.

30:07.096 --> 30:08.807
Why does it taste like makeup?

30:11.142 --> 30:13.228
This won't help me sleep. It's too gross.

30:16.439 --> 30:18.191
How do you like being a cop?

30:23.154 --> 30:25.073
I've been moved to the Narcotics Bureau.

30:28.368 --> 30:29.828
Now, it's starting for real.

30:33.915 --> 30:35.959
If I can find out who the gun belonged to…

30:38.086 --> 30:41.089
and what exactly Cha Giho
had to do with my dad's murder.

30:42.257 --> 30:43.383
Then I…

30:44.384 --> 30:45.885
I'll have more answers.

30:48.555 --> 30:49.931
Then I'll know who killed him.

30:56.646 --> 31:00.191
My dad and I used to talk about
building a beach house and live there.

31:02.026 --> 31:05.738
We'd hang a hammock out front
and we'd fish and swim every day

31:05.822 --> 31:07.574
like people with nothing to do.

31:10.702 --> 31:12.453
'Cause he wanted to live like that.

31:20.628 --> 31:23.339
And I always wonder
if he were still alive now…

31:27.218 --> 31:29.220
would we be able to live like that?

31:37.770 --> 31:39.105
Do you see that warehouse?

31:40.231 --> 31:42.066
Just about ten years ago,

31:42.150 --> 31:43.860
Donghoon saved my life over there.

31:45.778 --> 31:49.032
Everybody was attacking,
trying to take down the organization.

32:02.420 --> 32:03.630
Mujin!

32:17.977 --> 32:19.020
Hey.

32:19.103 --> 32:20.063
You psycho.

32:24.400 --> 32:25.693
Ah, shit.

32:25.777 --> 32:26.903
Hey.

32:26.986 --> 32:29.489
How can I possibly abandon you here?

32:29.572 --> 32:30.823
Come on.

32:30.907 --> 32:32.700
- It hurts, though. It hurts.
- Get up!

32:40.458 --> 32:42.085
Okay, guys.

32:42.168 --> 32:43.544
Smile for the camera.

32:44.295 --> 32:45.463
Will you be okay?

32:45.546 --> 32:47.173
Too old for this.

32:51.970 --> 32:53.346
I'm giving you my dagger.

32:59.227 --> 33:00.895
You kill him as soon as you can.

33:02.981 --> 33:04.107
Trust me.

33:05.650 --> 33:08.361
No matter what happens,
the organization will protect you.

33:39.976 --> 33:41.019
Later, okay?

33:45.982 --> 33:48.109
God, these questions
are fucking pointless.

33:48.192 --> 33:50.778
Hey, motherfucker!
You haven't answered me! Hey!

33:50.862 --> 33:52.363
- Hey! Why are you cursing the man?
- Did you hear? You…

33:52.447 --> 33:54.282
- You're not getting anything that way.
- Did you hear what he just called me?

33:54.365 --> 33:56.242
And he's all shaken up now.

33:56.325 --> 33:57.243
God.

33:57.326 --> 33:58.661
Changoo. Hey.

33:58.745 --> 34:00.246
Who cares about loyalty anymore?

34:00.329 --> 34:02.123
Money is the real boss, right?

34:02.915 --> 34:03.791
Here.

34:05.209 --> 34:08.254
The name's of five big dealers
and your boss, write it down, huh?

34:10.214 --> 34:11.632
Isn't your dad turning 60?

34:11.716 --> 34:13.092
Don't wanna miss the party.

34:13.593 --> 34:15.470
- Write it down.
- But I don't…

34:15.553 --> 34:16.679
Jesus, just forget it.

34:16.763 --> 34:18.556
There's plenty of other assholes
who will talk.

34:18.639 --> 34:21.184
- So get up, you little piece of shit.
- Wait! Hold on! Just hold on!

34:21.976 --> 34:22.935
No.

34:25.855 --> 34:27.690
I really can't just give up our boss.

34:27.774 --> 34:29.108
You little shit.

34:29.192 --> 34:30.943
It's like you're playing hard to get.

34:33.404 --> 34:35.615
You wanna ask me out, huh?

34:41.204 --> 34:42.830
I can't give you names.

34:44.874 --> 34:46.459
I can give you something else, though.

34:47.335 --> 34:48.294
What?

34:49.921 --> 34:51.047
Are you crazy?

34:51.631 --> 34:53.132
There's this candy that's really hot.

35:09.982 --> 35:11.484
Do you know who sell this stuff?

35:15.696 --> 35:17.156
CALL US ANYTIME IF YOU HAVE QUESTIONS

35:17.240 --> 35:18.533
You fucking asshole.
How dare you--

35:18.616 --> 35:19.784
Wait, wait, wait.

35:23.037 --> 35:23.996
Who is it?

35:25.998 --> 35:28.668
Mango.

35:30.837 --> 35:31.921
I'll be right back.

35:32.713 --> 35:33.965
INTERROGATION ROOM

35:34.048 --> 35:35.049
Hey.

35:36.050 --> 35:37.552
Mango is still your contact?

35:40.054 --> 35:41.013
Huh.

35:41.973 --> 35:44.225
Yeah, find out where Mango is.
Hold on. Don't hang up.

35:45.643 --> 35:48.771
NARCOTICS TEAM 1

35:48.855 --> 35:50.022
Why are you here?

35:52.400 --> 35:54.443
You don't let strangers in.

35:56.863 --> 35:59.740
- Park Changoo is still in questioning.
- Yeah, I know that, sir.

36:00.491 --> 36:03.077
- Then why are you here?
- I was just transferred to this bureau.

36:03.161 --> 36:04.704
Asshole.

36:04.787 --> 36:06.247
You fucking narc? Shit.

36:06.330 --> 36:07.790
Shut up. Stop that.

36:08.291 --> 36:09.625
Ah!

36:09.709 --> 36:11.294
Who's this?

36:11.377 --> 36:12.837
Uh, when did you get here?

36:13.379 --> 36:15.464
- Come in. Let's go. Let's go.
- Captain.

36:15.548 --> 36:16.507
But…

36:17.216 --> 36:18.843
- Here. Right this way.
- I'll call you back.

36:18.926 --> 36:19.969
Yes, sir.

36:21.012 --> 36:21.971
What…

36:24.223 --> 36:26.309
Captain. Captain.

36:27.727 --> 36:29.312
So, you just joined our team?

36:29.395 --> 36:30.396
What's going on?

36:30.479 --> 36:31.355
Your partner.

36:31.439 --> 36:33.441
Seriously, sir, I can't work with her.

36:33.524 --> 36:35.193
Junho's leg hasn't even healed yet.

36:35.776 --> 36:37.320
Well, that wasn't her fault.

36:37.403 --> 36:39.238
You just clashed while on the same case.

36:39.322 --> 36:41.616
Exactly. Don't you think
that's a bad sign, though?

36:41.699 --> 36:42.950
You want her for my partner…

36:43.743 --> 36:45.661
Do you want me to carry her on my back?

36:46.370 --> 36:48.664
She seems tenacious and very useful.

36:48.748 --> 36:50.291
She wants to catch someone.

36:51.459 --> 36:54.045
Well, who doesn't?

36:55.129 --> 36:57.506
You keep an eye on her
and see if she'll last here.

36:57.590 --> 36:59.592
Well, I don't think
she'll even last a month, sir.

36:59.675 --> 37:01.135
You look into the candy?

37:03.137 --> 37:04.305
Yeah.

37:04.388 --> 37:05.890
Park Changoo talked to us.

37:05.973 --> 37:07.141
Mango is the one.

37:07.225 --> 37:08.601
So, bring him in.

37:08.684 --> 37:09.685
Okay.

37:10.603 --> 37:12.855
We don't have time. The boat's here.

37:21.405 --> 37:22.949
It's not letting me log on.

37:23.032 --> 37:24.867
Our system is a different one.

37:24.951 --> 37:26.160
I think you need to register.

37:26.244 --> 37:27.828
Why do you wanna log on?

37:28.996 --> 37:31.123
So I can check the status
of the investigation.

37:31.666 --> 37:32.625
Ah…

37:32.708 --> 37:34.502
Status of the investigation.

37:34.585 --> 37:38.005
Status of the investigation is that
a moron wasted six months of work.

37:40.049 --> 37:41.509
I'm truly sorry about that.

37:41.592 --> 37:43.886
I can register you on our system now.

37:43.970 --> 37:46.264
Why even bother? Not like she lasts long.

37:49.600 --> 37:51.102
Well, what would you like me to do now?

37:54.355 --> 37:55.523
I don't know.

37:56.941 --> 37:58.276
No idea what to do with you.

38:06.117 --> 38:07.326
Huh.

38:08.244 --> 38:09.370
He's there?

38:10.037 --> 38:11.080
Got it.

38:12.665 --> 38:13.666
Let's go.

38:14.375 --> 38:16.294
- What?
- Time to get to work.

38:17.128 --> 38:18.796
- Mango.
- Okay.

38:26.470 --> 38:30.975
DEAD BODY OF BAE JUNGOO
CRIME SCENE PHOTOS

38:31.058 --> 38:32.727
SUICIDE NOTE FOUND WITH BODY

38:32.810 --> 38:35.104
MY DEAR WIFE AND DAUGHTER
I'M SORRY FOR LEAVING YOU

38:43.738 --> 38:44.905
Cha Giho here.

38:46.032 --> 38:48.909
I think it's Choi Mujin,
he's gonna make his move soon.

39:01.714 --> 39:04.467
Yamamoto has expressed interest
in striking a deal with us, sir.

39:06.719 --> 39:08.179
How big of a deal?

39:08.262 --> 39:10.556
The first transaction would be 50 billion.

39:13.768 --> 39:14.935
Should I refuse?

39:15.686 --> 39:18.647
It will become a problem
if we can't meet demand.

39:20.524 --> 39:22.026
They just found Mr. Bae.

39:22.693 --> 39:23.652
Hmm.

39:24.612 --> 39:26.864
I'll make a point of going there
next week.

39:30.368 --> 39:32.453
I don't think I've seen
that tumbler before.

39:33.496 --> 39:35.873
- Chamomile tea.
- Uh…

39:36.457 --> 39:38.000
Chamomile tea?

39:39.168 --> 39:40.669
Nice work, Ms. Kang.

39:53.057 --> 39:54.809
Jiwoo just joined the Narcotics Bureau.

39:56.310 --> 39:57.895
This will be very useful.

39:59.271 --> 40:00.940
And you really think you can trust her?

40:03.317 --> 40:04.944
I, myself, don't think
we should trust her.

40:06.404 --> 40:08.531
I trust the power of her desperation.

40:10.658 --> 40:12.576
Jiwoo will serve as our dagger.

40:12.660 --> 40:14.995
If things go south,
we'll have to kill her.

40:19.750 --> 40:20.876
That's correct.

40:40.646 --> 40:43.107
Goddamn it.
I just can't believe this.

40:43.899 --> 40:45.901
God, that was at the worst.

40:49.822 --> 40:52.533
So, the owner of this place
goes by "Mango", okay?

40:52.616 --> 40:53.909
Head in and bring him out.

40:56.871 --> 40:58.289
And what's he charged with?

40:58.372 --> 41:00.124
Huh. No need for Miranda rights
or anything.

41:00.207 --> 41:01.500
Just go in and bring him out.

41:03.377 --> 41:04.420
Go.

41:09.633 --> 41:10.759
Jesus.

41:23.355 --> 41:24.773
Uh, who are you?

41:26.525 --> 41:28.152
I'm here to meet with the owner.

41:29.153 --> 41:30.654
Uh…

41:30.738 --> 41:32.573
Are you like his new girl or something?

41:34.325 --> 41:36.285
Sorry, that's not my thing. Look.

41:37.912 --> 41:38.996
Mango? Where is he?

41:39.079 --> 41:40.247
Not here. Out.

41:40.831 --> 41:41.916
You have to learn to keep your hands

41:41.999 --> 41:42.917
- to yourself.
- Get out--

41:49.548 --> 41:53.052
Hey. Get out.

41:58.182 --> 42:00.100
Pildo. Did the rookie go inside?

42:00.184 --> 42:02.478
Yeah. Mango is gonna run out
holding the drugs.

42:02.561 --> 42:03.896
Get ready to go.

42:24.959 --> 42:26.252
Who's that?

42:26.335 --> 42:28.504
What the hell
is happening here? What is this?

42:48.274 --> 42:50.526
Fuck. What's taking her so long?

42:50.609 --> 42:51.986
How long has it been?

42:53.904 --> 42:54.863
Time to go.

43:24.226 --> 43:25.311
What the…

43:25.394 --> 43:26.270
What…

43:26.353 --> 43:28.731
What the hell did she do? Is he dead?

43:28.814 --> 43:31.191
Pildo. Hey. Pildo. Wait.

43:47.791 --> 43:50.127
Hey, hey. My arm! My arm!

43:54.673 --> 43:56.550
My arm! Shit!
